{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And you shall slaughter a Passover offering to YHWH your Elohim, of the flock.</b> For it is said (Exodus 12): ״מִן הַכְּבָשִׂים וּמִן הָעִזִּים תִּקָּחוּ״." "<b>And cattle.</b> You slaughter these for the festival offering — for if a large group was counted for the Passover offering, they bring with it a festival offering, so that it will be eaten upon satiety (Pesachim 69); and our Sages derived many more things from this verse."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:47:16.772646865Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}